    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115141" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χύτρος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύθρος</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			543.38
		</span></i>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χύτρα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				136
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHolm.</u>
				19.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl., of
				<i>deep holes</i> in Lake Copais, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.11.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Χύτροι,</span> name of <i>the hot
				springs</i> at Thermopylae, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.176
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Delph.</u>
				3(5).22.53
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pot-feast,</i> the 3rd day of the Anthesteria at
			Athens, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1076
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				218
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
